[{"category_id":"6a1e757298e3c90dd00b3f0d","label_id":[],"sort":9,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<span style=\"color:#444444;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\">厦门赛诺邦格生物科技股份有限公司致力于药物递送系统及医疗器械相关业务，研发、生产和销售高端药物递送载体\/原辅料、医用新材料，包括但不仅限于聚乙二醇衍生物、脂质产品、血糖控制类药物修饰剂、嵌段共聚物、ADC\/ProTAC连接子、生物可降解聚合物、外泌体、类病毒，并提供CDMO和解决方案服务，广泛应用于长效蛋白\/多肽药物、新冠mRNA疫苗、小核酸药物、血糖控制类药物、大分子胶束药物、脂质体药物、基因治疗药物、免疫抑制剂、ADC药物、ProTAC药物、医用水凝胶等。<br \/>\r\n<\/span>","title":"关于我们","intro":"ABOUT","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","bg_img":"","create_time":"2026-06-02 14:18:09","update_time":"2026-06-02 14:48:26","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"botImg":"","id":"6a1e75a110b5fc178d494b8b"},{"category_id":"","label_id":[],"sort":8,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: block; outline: none; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\" href=\"https:\/\/beian.miit.gov.cn\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Copyright &copy; 2020 厦门赛诺邦格生物科技股份有限公司 闽ICP备12006990号-6<\/a><\/p>","title":"网站底部-备案","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","bg_img":"","create_time":"2026-06-01 11:10:34","update_time":"2026-06-01 11:15:39","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1cf82a485fd200f815be37"},{"category_id":"6a1cefc7485fd200f815be33","label_id":[],"sort":7,"status":1,"type":"text","details":" ","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/Kx5n1780281418.png","acImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/zfqZ1780281424.png","title":"总部","intro":"厦门市湖里区泗水道669号厦门国贸商务中心","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","create_time":"2026-06-01 10:37:14","update_time":"2026-06-09 13:09:33","editTitle":false,"lat":"24.530917","long":"118.186344","readnum":0,"botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/dfqT1780981770.jpg","id":"6a1cf05af43e5f28f5576088"},{"category_id":"6a1cefc7485fd200f815be33","label_id":[],"sort":7,"status":1,"type":"text","details":" ","title":"工厂","intro":"厦门翔安区马巷镇数字时代广场","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/93jb1780281374.png","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","create_time":"2026-06-09 10:32:55","update_time":"2026-06-09 10:56:18","botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/e0gJ1780973663.png","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"acImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/kdDq1780281382.png","lat":"24.662436","long":"118.229296","id":"6a277b573d15f429a44cee92"},{"category_id":"6a1cefc7485fd200f815be33","label_id":[],"sort":6,"status":1,"type":"text","details":" ","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/93jb1780281374.png","acImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/kdDq1780281382.png","title":"工厂","intro":"厦门市翔安区火炬高新区(翔安)产业区建业楼D座","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","create_time":"2026-06-01 10:36:49","update_time":"2026-06-09 13:09:22","editTitle":false,"lat":"24.643375","long":"118.241525","readnum":0,"botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/CKbZ1780981757.jpg","id":"6a1cf0415fa82a33857d904e"},{"category_id":"6a16acfdb055ec6ea9349238","label_id":[],"sort":5,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p>无论您有任何不满或建议，均可填写<\/p>\n<p>下方投诉问卷、发送投诉邮件或拨打<\/p>\n<p>投诉热线，将会有专人跟进处理！<\/p>\n<p><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: block; outline: none; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 16px;\" href=\"http:\/\/djb.sinopeg.com.cn\/vm\/O078Qzw.aspx#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">点击此次进行投诉<\/a><\/p>\n<p>投诉邮箱：complains@sinopeg.com<\/p>\n<p>投诉专线：180-6444-0725<\/p>","title":"投诉建议","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/toE11780280368.png","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","create_time":"2026-06-01 10:19:37","update_time":"2026-06-01 10:37:29","botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/smFx1780280506.png","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1cec39e6833d73f524928c"},{"category_id":"6a1fa3c25d18e445640272f1","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","create_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:50","details":"扫码联系我们","editTitle":false,"intro":"","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":5,"status":1,"title":"微信","type":"text","update_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:50","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210518\/20210518134910_11907.png","id":"6a1fa67adfa97d67f45c72bb"},{"content_type":"text","category_id":"6a1576ad55a9703f216255b1","label_id":[],"sort":4,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t水凝胶是一种在水中充分溶胀而不溶解的亲水性高分子交联网络体系，其柔软，含水量高，富有弹性，具有良好的生物相容性，是理想的生物材料之一。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t聚乙二醇化水凝胶在医疗器械、药物的缓释控释和伤口的愈合等方面有着非常广泛的应用：例如对神经外科手术、颅内手术中的脑脊髓液溢出进行封堵；在血管、整形外科手术中可防止血液渗漏；在妇科、心脏手术中用于防黏连等。它可以作为将较低的药物长时间维持在患者体内的传输系统，当水凝胶被移植或注射到生物体后，水凝胶能够维持或向体液控制释放包埋在水凝胶中的药物，从而发挥疗效。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t我司提供的多臂聚乙二醇衍生物有四臂、六臂和八臂产品，包括其它一些特殊结构的聚乙二醇产品，都可用于交联成可降解聚乙二醇水凝胶。聚乙二醇水凝胶在医疗器械和再生医学中有着广泛的应用，特别是在药物释放和伤口愈合方面。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250910\/20250910102029_96879.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"700\" =\"\" align=\"\" \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>","title":"聚乙二醇化水凝胶","column_id":"6a154f4fdab8425b13019a77","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"水凝胶是一种在水中充分溶胀而不溶解的亲水性高分子交联网络体系，其柔软，含水量高，富有弹性，具有良好的生物相容性，是理想的生物材料之一。","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240418\/20240418165109_54793.png","create_time":"2025-09-10 17:03:23","update_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:39","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1576c459dc1f34333991d2"},{"category_id":"6a16acfdb055ec6ea9349238","label_id":[],"sort":4,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p>公司总部：厦门湖里区泗水道669号厦门国贸商务中心<\/p>\n<p>生产基地：厦门翔安区火炬高新区产业区建业楼D座<\/p>\n<p>生产基地：厦门翔安区马巷镇数字时代广场4号楼<\/p>","title":"地址","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/g3bA1780280262.png","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","create_time":"2026-06-01 10:17:58","update_time":"2026-06-01 10:21:27","botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/idJS1780280485.png","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1cebd67e7e192c2506c826"},{"category_id":"6a1fa3c25d18e445640272f1","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","create_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:49","details":"1901848004","editTitle":false,"intro":"1901848004","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":4,"status":1,"title":"QQ","type":"text","update_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:49","bg_img":"","id":"6a1fa6799508801401772592"},{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210301\/20210301150223_54752.png","category_id":"6a1576ad55a9703f216255b1","column_id":"6a154f4fdab8425b13019a77","content_type":"text","create_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:39","details":"<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t聚乙二醇及其衍生物是目前为数不多的通过美国FDA认证的可用于生物医药产品的聚合物。官能化聚乙二醇是一类具有官能性基团的聚乙二醇衍生物，又称作活性聚乙二醇。利用PEG衍生物的活性基团同药物分子（包括蛋白药物和有机小分子药物）、肽类、糖类、脂类、生物材料等进行化学耦合，达到对药物分子的聚乙二醇修饰，称为聚乙二醇化。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t经过聚乙二醇化的药物具有以下优势：\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※更长的半衰期\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※较小的毒性\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※更好的溶解性\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※用药频率降低\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※血药浓度波动低\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※较少的酶降解作用\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※较少的免疫原性及抗原性\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t※提高病人的依从性\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<div>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210301\/20210301150007_63475.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/> \r\n<\/div>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t⒈线性单甲氧基PEG\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t线性单甲氧基PEG在药物修饰中的应用最早可追溯到二十世纪八十年代，修饰技术按蛋白上偶联的PEG链的个数可以分为多修饰和单修饰两方面。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t⒉线性双官能化PEG\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tPEG修饰技术还可以应用于新型小分子药物的开发，用以解决小分子药物，尤其是抗肿瘤剂，在应用中经常面临一些问题，如低溶解度、高毒性、迅速血液排除或无选择性的生物体内分布等。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t2004年，Enzon公司开始了Pegamotecan (PEG-Camptothecin，聚乙二醇化喜树碱)药物的临床研究。该药物即应用了线性双官能化PEG：一分子PEG偶联两个药物分子，可以使载药量提高；同时，PEG的修饰也增加了小分子药物的水溶性。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t⒊线性异官能化PEG\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tPEG修饰技术应用于药物，能带来药物体内分布的“被动靶向”性质，使修饰产物倾向于积累在肝脏及肿瘤组织部位。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t异官能化PEG用于连接靶导与化疗胞毒药物的策略具有以下优点：⑴PEG分子带来的“被动靶向”、低毒副作用、延长体内循环时间、增加水溶性、提高生物相容性等作用；⑵靶导分子带来的定位于肿瘤组织的靶向性作用。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t⒋双臂官能化PEG\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t蛋白的PEG修饰技术正在往PEG分子量更大，定点单修饰技术方向发展。大PEG分子定点单修饰的优点体现在：①增加“被动靶向”作用；②半衰期更长，甚至可能完全消除肾过滤；③更有效降低蛋白免疫原性；④产品质量更加均一、稳定、可控。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t因此，双链PEG的优势就体现于：⑴更易做成更大的分子量，只要拼接两份20kD的单链PEG即可得到40kD的更大分子的PEG；⑵分子量越大的PEG，其分散度PDI就更加不好控制，由两较小PEG分子拼接成的双臂PEG,，其PDI较同分子量的单链PEG更加好控制；⑶反应活性更低，具有一定的位点选择性，不易进入蛋白活性位点，而使修饰产物保留更多的生物活性；⑷具有伞形结果，屏蔽效应更强，保护蛋白不被蛋白酶水解以及与抗体结合，具有更大的作用。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>","editTitle":false,"intro":"利用PEG衍生物的活性基团通药物分子（包括蛋白药物和有机小分子药物）、肽类、糖类、脂类、生物材料等进行化学耦合，达到对药物分子的聚乙二醇修饰，称为聚乙二醇化。","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":3,"status":1,"title":"聚乙二醇化药物","type":"text","update_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:39","id":"6a16b1c7262c0c5b9e65c40d"},{"category_id":"6a16acfdb055ec6ea9349238","label_id":[],"sort":3,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p>国内热线：400-918-9898<\/p>\n<p>国际热线：+1-844-QUAL-PEG<\/p>\n<p>微信 \/ 电话：17359873007<\/p>\n<p>产品需求：sales@sinopeg.com<\/p>\n<p>招贤纳士：sihanyu@sinopeg.com<\/p>","title":"电话","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/VuOj1780280168.png","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","create_time":"2026-06-01 10:17:16","update_time":"2026-06-01 10:22:11","botImg":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/cf5p1780280528.png","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1cebac79433f3c11747a69"},{"category_id":"6a1fa3c25d18e445640272f1","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","create_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:48","details":"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/%E5%8E%A6%E9%97%A8%E8%B5%9B%E8%AF%BA%E9%82%A6%E6%A0%BC%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8\/?viewAsMember=true","editTitle":false,"intro":"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/%E5%8E%A6%E9%97%A8%E8%B5%9B%E8%AF%BA%E9%82%A6%E6%A0%BC%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8\/?viewAsMember=true","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":3,"status":1,"title":"领英链接","type":"text","update_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:48","bg_img":"","id":"6a1fa678f43e5f28f55761a8"},{"content_type":"text","category_id":"6a15767a21dbfc72fd5082d2","label_id":[],"sort":2,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">厦门赛诺邦格生物科技有限公司致力于为客户提供专业的定制合成服务，专注于多种精细化学品及高分子材料的研发与生产。公司核心定制产品包括：<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">多分散聚乙二醇衍生物：<\/strong>具备不同分子量分布的PEG衍生物，广泛应用于药物修饰、生物偶联和材料表面改性，可显著改善药物的水溶性、稳定性和体内循环时间。<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" \/><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" \/><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">单分散聚乙二醇衍生物：<\/strong>高纯度、结构明确的PEG产品，适用于精密医学研究、靶向药物开发以及体外诊断试剂的制备，提供更可控的物化性质和生物活性。<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">脂质纳米粒辅料：<\/strong>提供包括可离子化脂质、磷脂、胆固醇和PEG脂质在内LNP组成脂质定制，支持核酸药物*、靶向递送。<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">嵌段共聚物：<\/strong>提供两亲性或功能性嵌段共聚物的定制合成，可自组装形成胶束、囊泡等结构，应用于药物递送系统、纳米材料及智能高分子领域。<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">公司可根据客户需求提供从克级到公斤级的一站式定制合成解决方案，助力医药研发、生物技术与新材料创新。<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 0px none inherit;\">厦门赛诺邦格拥有一支由留学归国博士以及外籍专家领衔的技术团队，并与厦门大学、复旦大学、中科院化学所等国内高校研究所建立良好的合作关系，具有较高的技术开发实力，可以根据客户的需求，提供反应、纯化、分离以及终产物分析等全套服务。<\/p>\n<p><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\" \/><span style=\"color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">公司通过ISO13485和ISO9001认证，实验室和生产车间严格按照美国FDA的cGMP标准进行设计和建造，配备先进的生产和检测设备，采用先进的技术，具备批量生产的能力，可以提供cGMP质量和Non-cGMP质量的产品。请通过邮箱：sales@sinopeg.com联系我们。您也可以进入我们的产品页面或在我们的搜索框中键入产品名称，CAS或其他关键字，以找出相关产品的信息。<\/span><\/p>","title":"定制合成","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/J6iq1779845799.png","column_id":"6a154fac453b2b53a31fe55b","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","create_time":"2026-05-27 09:36:49","update_time":"2026-05-27 09:36:49","id":"6a164ab199a77725b86f9c87"},{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210112\/20210112170256_31492.png","category_id":"6a1576ad55a9703f216255b1","column_id":"6a154f4fdab8425b13019a77","content_type":"text","create_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:39","details":"<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t厦门赛诺邦格提供的聚乙二醇羟基原料具有杂质少、纯度高、质量好、分子量分布窄的特点。如图所示，与市面上其它厂家的产品相比较，我们公司的mPEG-OH-20k杂质更低，分子量更精确，二醇含量更低。使用我们的聚乙二醇羟基作为原材料，可以得到更高纯度和活性的聚乙二醇衍生物。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210301\/20210301160056_32178.png\" alt=\"\" \/> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210301\/20210301160111_71278.png\" alt=\"\" \/> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t厦门赛诺邦格具有多年生产聚乙二醇羟基原料的经验，可以为聚乙二醇化药物从开发阶段到商业化应用提供活化性能强的聚乙二醇衍生物。我司提供分子量从5k到80k的聚乙二醇羟基原料。\r\n<\/p>","editTitle":false,"intro":"厦门赛诺邦格提供的聚乙二醇羟基原料具有杂质少、纯度高、质量好、分子量分布窄的特点。","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":2,"status":1,"title":"聚乙二醇羟基原料","type":"text","update_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:39","id":"6a16b1c741b6523d0d6ae041"},{"category_id":"6a17ff5841b6523d0d6ae191","label_id":[],"sort":2,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; font-size: 18px; color: #1459a8; text-align: center; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; border: 0px none inherit;\">产品需求：sales@sinopeg.com<\/span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; font-size: 18px; color: #1459a8; text-align: center; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; border: 0px none inherit;\">招贤纳士：sihanyu@sinopeg.com<\/span><\/p>","title":"邮箱","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","bg_img":"","create_time":"2026-05-28 16:40:42","update_time":"2026-05-28 16:40:42","id":"6a17ff8aabf4e627f92965d3"},{"category_id":"6a1fa3c25d18e445640272f1","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","create_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:48","details":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Xiamen-Sinopeg-Biotech-Co-Ltd-105042418272501\/?view_public_for=105042418272501","editTitle":false,"intro":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Xiamen-Sinopeg-Biotech-Co-Ltd-105042418272501\/?view_public_for=105042418272501","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":2,"status":1,"title":"Facebook链接","type":"text","update_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:48","bg_img":"","id":"6a1fa678b5f9d042d0010e21"},{"content_type":"text","category_id":"6a15767a21dbfc72fd5082d2","label_id":[],"sort":1,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p><span style=\"color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">厦门赛诺邦格生物科技有限公司依托现代分离与分析技术，为医药研发与生产企业提供专业的杂质研究服务，涵盖化学合成原辅料的杂质检测与定量分析。杂质作为药品关键质量属性，直接关系到药物的安全性和有效性，其来源复杂多样，包括工艺起始物料、副反应产物、中间体、降解物、残留试剂、配体及催化剂等，既可能是已鉴定或未鉴定的，也包括挥发性和非挥发性组分。<\/span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\" \/><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\" \/><span style=\"color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">针对创新药，赛诺邦格可系统评估其原辅料在生产过程中可能引入的工艺相关杂质，或在贮存期间因降解产生的新杂质，厘清杂质谱系，为申报与质量控制提供依据。对于仿制药及已上市药品发生生产变更（如调整工艺、更换原辅料）的情形，企业需对可能新增的杂质进行再分析和评估，并据此修订原有质量标准，依规报药品监管部门审批。赛诺邦格在此过程中提供科学、严谨的杂质研究支持，协助客户顺利完成质量论证与注册申报。<\/span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\" \/><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\" \/><span style=\"color: #090909; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">公司配备*液相色谱（HPLC）、气相色谱（GC）、质谱（MS）等先进仪器平台，结合丰富的杂质研究经验，建立并验证灵敏、专属的分析方法，实现对各类杂质的识别与定量。赛诺邦格始终以科学精神和严谨态度为客户提供可靠、公正的检测数据与技术支持，其高水平的技术服务与专业能力赢得了市场的广泛认可与好评。有任何需求均可通过网站留言或邮箱：sales@sinopeg.com联系我们。<\/span><\/p>","title":"杂质分析","column_id":"6a154fac453b2b53a31fe55b","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/bucket\/Hj6U1779845681.png","create_time":"2026-05-27 09:33:40","update_time":"2026-05-27 09:34:53","editTitle":false,"readnum":0,"id":"6a1649f4cbeb8235be3bdec6"},{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20210301\/20210301163121_95773.png","category_id":"6a1576ad55a9703f216255b1","column_id":"6a154f4fdab8425b13019a77","content_type":"text","create_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:40","details":"<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t单分散聚乙二醇衍生物是一种含有单一分子量的多个重复单元的小分子PEG，可应用于药物递送、药物载体、蛋白修饰等多个方面。<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250910\/20250910102551_22489.png\" alt=\"\" \/><br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n⒈PROTAC Linker<br \/>\r\nPROTAC (proteolysis targeting chimeras) 是一类异双功能分子。PROTAC分子由三部分构成，一端是结合需要降解的靶蛋白配体分子，另一端为结合E3泛素化连接酶的配体分子，中间则由特定的Linker连接器相连接。PROTAC 分子通过上述配体将需要降解的目标靶蛋白与E3泛素化连接酶相连接，从而使目标靶蛋白泛素化并进一步由蛋白酶体降解。而PROTAC分子却不会被蛋白酶体降解，进而循环使用。<br \/>\r\n相比较一般的小分子抑制剂，PROTAC分子通过不依赖占位驱动的方式催化蛋白降解功能，展现出极为优良的高选择性，低毒性，并能有效克服传统小分子抑制剂的耐药性。PEG已作为PROTAC Linker被广泛应用。<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n⒉ADC Linker<br \/>\r\n抗体药物偶联物（Antibody Drug Conjugates，ADC）是一类新颖的治疗药物，正日益受到全球制药公司的关注。ADC药物由单克隆抗体和强效毒性药物（toxic drug）通过生物活性连接器（Linker）偶联而成，是一种定点靶向癌细胞的强效抗癌药物。由于其对靶点的准确识别性及非癌细胞不受影响性，极大地提高了药效并减少了毒副作用。<br \/>\r\n在药物输送中,PEG可用作抗体-药物偶联物（ADC）的连接体或用作纳米粒子的表面涂层以改善全身性药物输送。研究发现，在小分子药物中接入单分散PEG可增加药物的溶解度和分子量，从而延长药物在体内的半衰期，同时可以减少高分子PEG修饰蛋白时产生的空间位阻和结合的影响。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>","editTitle":false,"intro":"单分散聚乙二醇衍生物是一种含有单一分子量的多个重复单元的小分子PEG，可应用于药物递送、药物载体、蛋白修饰等多个方面。","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":1,"status":1,"title":"单分散聚乙二醇","type":"text","update_time":"2026-05-27 16:56:40","id":"6a16b1c8f838b12b9c34b581"},{"category_id":"6a17ff5841b6523d0d6ae191","label_id":[],"sort":1,"status":1,"type":"text","details":"<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; font-size: 18px; color: #1459a8; text-align: center; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; border: 0px none inherit;\">国内销售热线：400-918-9898<\/span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; font-size: 18px; color: #1459a8; text-align: center; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei-Regular'; border: 0px none inherit;\">国际销售热线：+1-844-QUAL-PEG<\/span><\/p>","title":"电话","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","intro":"","bg_img":"","create_time":"2026-05-28 16:40:26","update_time":"2026-05-28 16:40:26","id":"6a17ff7ab055ec6ea9349379"},{"category_id":"6a1fa3c25d18e445640272f1","column_id":"6a155022a1714c7afa1a42f2","create_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:14","details":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/SINOPEG1","editTitle":false,"intro":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/SINOPEG1","label_id":[],"readnum":0,"site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","sort":1,"status":1,"title":"Twitter链接","type":"text","update_time":"2026-06-03 11:58:47","bg_img":"","id":"6a1fa6562dc1364144418a13"}]